Fonts vendored in this directory
================================

These fonts are used by docs/list_of_commands.html. They are kept here, separate
from src/resources/fonts/, so the documentation is self-contained and does not
reach into the application source tree.

Inter
  Copyright (c) 2016 The Inter Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter)
  SIL Open Font License 1.1 - full text in LICENSE.Inter
  Files: Inter-*.woff2

Fira Code
  Copyright (c) 2014, The Fira Code Project Authors
  (https://github.com/tonsky/FiraCode)
  SIL Open Font License 1.1 - full text in LICENSE.FiraCode
  Files: FiraCode-*.woff2

  The OFL requires that this license notice accompany the font files whenever
  they are redistributed. Both license files are shipped verbatim rather than
  merged, because the two texts differ slightly.

fonts.css
  Generated from the Google Fonts CSS this page previously fetched at runtime,
  with the remote URLs rewritten to the local files above. This file is a copy
  of src/resources/fonts/fonts.css; if either is regenerated, update both.

Note: the KaTeX fonts under src/resources/fonts/ are NOT duplicated here. They
are MIT licensed rather than OFL, and this page does not use KaTeX.
